Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.23,0:00:04.20,Sub,,0,0,0,{\fad(70,70)},It had rained in Sol for\Nnine years.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.18,0:00:06.89,Sub,,0,0,0,{\fad(70,70)},One man never got wet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.87,0:00:09.73,Sub,,0,0,0,{\fad(70,70)},They called him Aura\Nmonster.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.71,0:00:13.12,Sub,,0,0,0,{\fad(70,70)},Midnight, no coat, no hat,\Nbone dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:14.83,Sub,,0,0,0,{\fad(70,70)},The shopkeepers said luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.81,0:00:16.89,Sub,,0,0,0,{\fad(70,70)},The police said a trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.87,0:00:19.25,Sub,,0,0,0,{\fad(70,70)},The kids said magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.23,0:00:21.19,Sub,,0,0,0,{\fad(70,70)},So one night I followed\Nhim.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.17,0:00:22.90,Sub,,0,0,0,{\fad(70,70)},The rain stopped around\Nme.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.88,0:00:24.75,Sub,,0,0,0,{\fad(70,70)},Then I saw why.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.73,0:00:26.30,Sub,,0,0,0,{\fad(70,70)},He wasn't dodging the\Nstorm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.28,0:00:31.13,Sub,,0,0,0,{\fad(70,70)},He was holding it up, one\Nwalk at a time, so the\Ncity could sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.11,0:00:33.66,Sub,,0,0,0,{\fad(70,70)},He turned, tired, and\Nsmiled.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.64,0:00:34.86,Sub,,0,0,0,{\fad(70,70)},“Your turn.”
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.84,0:00:37.64,Sub,,0,0,0,{\fad(70,70)},Now I walk these streets\Nat midnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.62,0:00:39.58,Sub,,0,0,0,{\fad(70,70)},And I never get wet.
